            "notes": "### FOR YOUR THIRD POWER: \nFirst responder scales off AP, and this is a sneaky rez build, so GET IT! If you need more healing you can get Triage Unit for some more burst healing. If you're dying a lot I recommend Serenity. If both things are happening, welp. GG DPS gap (jk) ;3\n\n### IF YOU WON: \nPrioritize [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f)! If selling one or both of your blue items would give you enough for [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) you can go for it, but do what's best depending on how your team is doing. \n\n### IF YOU LOST: \nTry to catch up on the build by purchasing any purple items you haven't yet from the previous rounds.",
