            "notes": "### IF YOU WON: \n[Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) time! If selling both of your blue items gives you enough for [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448), go for it.\n\n### IF YOU LOST: \nIf you need more survivability, any of the items I marked as optional earlier are still a good idea, or you can even buy an epic survival item such as [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) or [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c). Just try to have as much AP and CDR as possible!",
