            "notes": "### POWER: \nYour last power really depends on the situation your team is in. You can be flexible with what you choose as long as you think its what is best for your team!\n\n### FULL BUILD TIME!!! You should have 40% AP and 40% CDR. \n\nThe five purple items below should be your final build, with your last item being a flex spot that you can fill with whatever you think will help your team best. You can sell [Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88) for a better/more beneficial item or keep it, up to you! I provided some example items that I think you can choose from comfortably.\n\nI hope this build helped! If it didn't and you lost then I'm sorry!! :c \n\nThis build isn't for every team comp, I find it runs best when you have a Rein or Zarya and at least one ranged DPS.\n\nGG!",
